ong>Challenging Bosses &amp; Elites</strong>: Test your deckbuilding skills against 6 unique bosses and 12 elite enemies. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Your Firework Show</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544040/extras/d1bf5302f11550d2f87ff921bf5d4753.poster.avif?t=1738556112\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544040/extras/d1bf5302f11550d2f87ff921bf5d4753.webm?t=1738556112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544040/extras/d1bf5302f11550d2f87ff921bf5d4753.mp4?t=1738556112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've built the perfect deck, sit back and enjoy the stunning fireworks display you've crafted. Amaze your audience, collect rewards, and get ready for the next show!</p>",
